<summary>LLVM IR — A structural invariant is measured at a particular stage</summary>

Count N immediately before building the dispatcher, after SSA preparation. This helper adds two blocks, so its result has N+2 blocks. Do not blindly assert input N+1 from the old roadmap: a different design or earlier preparation can change that count. A test must describe this algorithm, not a remembered number.

Checkpoint: Which stage’s block count does your test record?

</details>

